.. code-block::

    BaseLanguageModel --> BaseLLM --> LLM --> <name>  # Examples: AI21, HuggingFaceHub, OpenAI

**Main helpers:**

.. code-block::

    LLMResult, PromptValue,
    CallbackManagerForLLMRun, AsyncCallbackManagerForLLMRun,
    CallbackManager, AsyncCallbackManager,
