**LLM** classes provide
access to the large language model (**LLM**) APIs and services.

**Class hierarchy:**

.. code-block::

    BaseLanguageModel --> BaseLLM --> LLM --> <name>  # Examples: AI21, HuggingFaceHub, OpenAI

**Main helpers:**

.. code-block::

    LLMResult, PromptValue,
